  "notes": [
    "- **Sans** brings the curve-based upright and italic rebuild to 1.0.0, including the shared punctuation components and fitted repeated-letter ligatures.",
    "- **System** derives its larger lowercase and shared components from rebuilt Sans. It includes calibrated optical sizing, a compensated 94\u2013108% width axis, and optional tabular figures.",
    "- **System Italic** uses italic `q` as the spacing and kerning reference for cursive `g` and its accented forms.",
    "- **Interactive proofs** let you type a sample, compare axes, and inspect individual glyphs in both families. [Try Daikonic Transit](https://daikonic-org.github.io/transit-typeface/)"
